<item>
<title>Stalled U.S. housing bill leaves 4–6 million unit shortage intact</title>
<link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/06/25/us/politics/trump-housing-bill-scenarios.html</link>
<description>President Trump withheld signature from the bipartisan 21st Century ROAD to Housing Act after it passed 358–32 and 85–15, tying it to the SAVE voter-ID bill. Unnoticed effect: regulatory relief and local construction incentives remain frozen, extending the affordability crisis through another building season.</description>
<pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
