<item>
<title>Haiti gangs seize Kenscoff heights above Port-au-Prince</title>
<link>https://www.crisisgroup.org/sco/global/our-radar</link>
<description>Armed groups killed at least 47 and abducted more than 50 in overnight raids 23–24 August. Unnoticed effect: the UN-backed Gang Suppression Force remains far below planned strength, allowing gangs to control high ground overlooking the capital while the force is still assembling.</description>
<pubDate>Thu, 04 Sep 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
<guid isPermaLink="false">haiti-kenscoff-2026</guid>
