<title>Nepal glacier-landslide death toll exceeds 1,010 with 4,400 missing</title>
<link>https://newrepublic.com/article/215007/goodbye-least-apocalyptic-summer-rest-life</link>
<description>A rockslide on Langtang Lirung pulled a glacier down, burying valleys. Unnoticed effect: identification of remains and reconstruction of high-altitude communities lag far behind headlines, leaving entire districts without winter stores or roads.</description>
<pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
