<item>
<title>U.S. resumes strikes on Iranian coastal launchers and mines</title>
<link>https://www.crisisgroup.org/sco/global/our-radar</link>
<description>After a month-long pause, U.S. forces hit rocket launchers on Larak Island and dozens of southern-coast military sites. Unnoticed effect: the attacks reopen a second front while Iran’s nuclear program status after earlier strikes remains unresolved, raising covert-enrichment risk.</description>
